1
00:00:00,091 --> 00:00:03,131
Oh, it's like someone
sawed a cow in half.

2
00:00:05,296 --> 00:00:09,336
My father's a gynecologist,
I think I can handle it.

3
00:00:09,567 --> 00:00:11,907
(Raj:)And, now I'm gay.

4
00:00:14,472 --> 00:00:15,682
(Bernadette:)You know, I was thinking,

5
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:17,480
(Bernadette:)without Sheldon most of us
would have never met,

6
00:00:17,608 --> 00:00:19,518
(Bernadette:)but Penny would still
live across from him.

7
00:00:20,678 --> 00:00:22,458
(Amy:)And with Leonard out of the picture,

8
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:24,030
(Amy:)we all know what that would mean.

9
00:00:24,782 --> 00:00:25,822
(Penny:)We do?

10
00:00:29,453 --> 00:00:30,593
(Penny:)Hey, Sheldon.

11
00:00:30,688 --> 00:00:32,168
(Stuart:)Hello.

12
00:00:33,791 --> 00:00:35,931
(Penny:)Doing laundry?

13
00:00:39,930 --> 00:00:41,970
(Sheldon:)Of course I'm doing laundry.

14
00:00:42,099 --> 00:00:43,669
(Sheldon:)Saturday night is laundry night,

15
00:00:43,801 --> 00:00:46,181
(Sheldon:)and I'm in a laundry room, so...

16
00:00:46,303 --> 00:00:48,043
(Sheldon:)I believe your inference is justified.

17
00:00:48,205 --> 00:00:50,615
(Penny:)My inference is justified.

18
00:00:50,708 --> 00:00:53,278
(Penny:)Sheldon, you are so funny.

19
00:00:56,447 --> 00:00:58,447
(Penny:)Anyway, I need to do my laundry, too,

20
00:00:58,549 --> 00:01:02,019
(Penny:)because these clothes are so dirty.

